66	  /// `AppLifecycleState.resumed` (Boundaries: `inactive`/`hidden` are not
67	  /// "backgrounded" on their own — only this pair bounds iOS's actual
68	  /// background/foreground transition). `null` means either the app has
69	  /// never been backgrounded, or the last `paused`->`resumed` cycle already
70	  /// consumed it.
